<%- include('_head', { title: '註冊', narrow: true }) %>
<%- include('_nav', { user: null }) %>

<div class="card">
  <h1 style="font-size:1.3rem; margin-bottom:6px;">註冊家長帳號</h1>
  <p class="muted small" style="margin-bottom:18px;">需要指導師或系統管理員給你的期別邀請碼。</p>

  <% if (error) { %><div class="flash err"><%= error %></div><% } %>

  <form method="post" action="/register">
    <div class="field">
      <label for="real_name">真實姓名</label>
      <input id="real_name" name="real_name" type="text" required maxlength="40" value="<%= typeof real_name !== 'undefined' ? real_name : '' %>">
      <small>讓指導師和老師知道你是誰，方便聯繫，不會公開顯示給其他學員。</small>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="display_name">暱稱（選填）</label>
      <input id="display_name" name="display_name" type="text" maxlength="40" value="<%= typeof display_name !== 'undefined' ? display_name : '' %>">
      <small>這個會顯示在動態牆和達標風雲榜給同期學員看到。不填的話就直接用真實姓名；想匿名的話可以在這裡填別的稱呼。</small>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="email">Email</label>
      <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required value="<%= typeof email !== 'undefined' ? email : '' %>">
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="password">設定密碼</label>
      <input id="password" name="password" type="password" required minlength="6">
      <small>至少6個字元</small>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="join_code">期別邀請碼</label>
      <input id="join_code" name="join_code" type="text" required maxlength="20" style="text-transform:uppercase;" value="<%= typeof join_code !== 'undefined' ? join_code : '' %>">
    </div>
    <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">建立帳號</button>
  </form>

  <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:16px;">已經有帳號？<a href="/login">登入</a></p>
</div>

<%- include('_foot') %>
